WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.267 --> 00:00:19.203
Rat stuck out a brown paw.

2
00:00:19.204 --> 00:00:21.936
He grabbed Toad by the neck.

3
00:00:21.937 --> 00:00:25.422
"Here you go, Toad!" said Rat.

4
00:00:25.423 --> 00:00:29.203
Rat pulled Toad into his hole.

5
00:00:29.204 --> 00:00:32.948
"Oh Ratty!" cried Toad.

6
00:00:32.949 --> 00:00:36.015
"My life has been awful!

7
00:00:36.016 --> 00:00:38.421
Everyone was chasing me!

8
00:00:38.422 --> 00:00:43.027
I've suffered so much!"

9
00:00:43.028 --> 00:00:47.610
"Well, you're safe now," said Rat.

10
00:00:47.611 --> 00:00:50.548
Rat patted Toad's head.

11
00:00:50.549 --> 00:00:55.626
Then Toad smiled proudly.

12
00:00:55.627 --> 00:00:59.417
"I escaped from jail!" he shouted.

13
00:00:59.418 --> 00:01:01.940
"And I stole a horse!

14
00:01:01.941 --> 00:01:05.674
Oh, I am a clever Toad!

15
00:01:05.675 --> 00:01:08.555
I'll tell you all about it!"

16
00:01:08.556 --> 00:01:12.601
"Wait," said Rat, holding up a paw.

17
00:01:12.602 --> 00:01:15.817
"First, go change your clothes."

18
00:01:15.818 --> 00:01:19.801
"What?" asked Toad, confused.

19
00:01:19.802 --> 00:01:23.680
"You look like a washwoman," said Rat.

20
00:01:23.681 --> 00:01:27.868
Toad held up a corner of his dress.

21
00:01:27.869 --> 00:01:31.945
"Oh this," he said shyly.

22
00:01:31.946 --> 00:01:36.008
"It's a long story. I—"

23
00:01:36.009 --> 00:01:40.605
"Stop talking and clean yourself up!" said Rat.

24
00:01:40.606 --> 00:01:42.817
"You look a mess!"

25
00:01:42.818 --> 00:01:47.881
"Now, Rat," said Toad, getting angry.

26
00:01:47.882 --> 00:01:51.827
Then he saw himself in the mirror.

27
00:01:51.828 --> 00:01:54.868
"Oh my," said Toad.

28
00:01:54.869 --> 00:01:57.205
"I do look awful."

29
00:01:57.206 --> 00:02:01.389
He ran to the bedroom to wash up.

30
00:02:01.390 --> 00:02:06.013
Toad put on some of Rat's best clothes.

31
00:02:06.014 --> 00:02:08.738
He looked in the mirror again.

32
00:02:08.739 --> 00:02:12.607
"I'm so handsome!" he said.

33
00:02:12.608 --> 00:02:18.907
"Who could think I was a washwoman?"
